@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #486777
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EEF5FA
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #486777
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam packageBorderColor #486777
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EEF5FA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B59865
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam padding 8
title Request/response boundary — protocol-neutral contract
actor "Authorized user" as User
boundary "Product interface" as Boundary
control "Scoped operation" as Operation
participant "External provider (if applicable)" as Provider
User -> Boundary : exact intended operation + resource/context
Boundary -> Operation : validate current authority and input
alt denied / invalid / stale
 Operation --> Boundary : scoped denial / validation / conflict
else eligible local-only operation
 Operation --> Boundary : attributable local result
else eligible external effect
 Operation -> Provider : scoped selected operation
 alt confirmed provider result
  Provider --> Operation : attributable result
  Operation --> Boundary : result with actual effect meaning
 else transport response absent / uncertain
  Operation --> Boundary : unknown effect; reconcile exact operation
 end
end
Boundary --> User : permitted result, not secret diagnostics

legend bottom
Logical API interaction. Endpoint, HTTP method/status, gRPC and retry policy remain unselected; no automatic retry promise.
endlegend
@enduml
